<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Rothmans sees substantial profit rise.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Rothmans sees substantial profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cigarette manufacturer Rothmans Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it expected a substantial improvement in profit for the six months to September 30, 1996 compared with the first half of the 1995/96 year.</p>
</text>
